      "Created": "2026-09-02T04:21:16.599-07:00",
      "EntryType": "Event",
      "Id": "283",
      "Message": "Leak detector '/xyz/openbmc_project/state/leak/detector/Nvidia_SMA_10_LEAKDETECTOR_0' reports a critical level leak.",
